  m_text: 'ARROW KEYS     Move during your turn

    A / D                Traverse
    the turret

    W / S                Raise / lower the barrel

    Q / E                
    Adjust firing power

    SPACE              Fire

    RMB DRAG       Orbit camera

    MOUSE
    WHEEL  Zoom      F  Focus tank

    ESC                   Pause / resume


    Use
    hills and rubble as cover. Avoid the water.'
